Subject: [PATCH 11/20] =?UTF-8?q?elden:=20cdsp=20=E2=80=94=20=E7=94=A8=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?tock=20split=20=E5=9B=BA=E4=BB=B6=20(cdsp.mdt/cdsp=5Fdtb.mdt)?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E5=8F=96=E4=BB=A3=E5=8D=95=E6=96=87=E4=BB=B6=20.mbn?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

TZ PAS init 对单文件 cdsp_dtb.mbn 返回 -22；stock SunP DTS 用的是
split 镜像 (qcom/sun-cdsp-pas firmware-name = "cdsp.mdt", "cdsp_dtb.mdt")。
dtb_pas_id=0x25 经反汇编 stock qcom_q6v5_pas.ko 的 sun_cdsp_resource 证实
正确（原「PAS id 不匹配」假设否证）。改回 split 后冷启 remoteproc1
(cdsp) state=running，dmesg: 'remote processor cdsp is now up'。

注意：固件由 initramfs 加载（磁盘 rootfs 版本未生效，-2 ENOENT），
故载具 ramdisk 必须含 split 文件。
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts
index 3f31a9e9b..194bc8685 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts
@@ -2640,8 +2640,13 @@ compute-cb@8 {
 };
 
 &remoteproc_cdsp {
-	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8750/cdsp.mbn",
-			"qcom/sm8750/cdsp_dtb.mbn";
+	/* Stock SM8750P (SunP) DTS uses the split images: "cdsp.mdt", "cdsp_dtb.mdt".
+	 * The earlier single-file override (cdsp.mbn / cdsp_dtb.mbn) made TZ return
+	 * -22 from PAS init on the DTB; the single DTB build is not the signed stock
+	 * image.  Match stock (verified from backup/stock-elden/dtb/...SunP_SoC.dtb).
+	 */
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8750/cdsp.mdt",
+			"qcom/sm8750/cdsp_dtb.mdt";
 
 	status = "okay";
 };
